        "Content": "Architect designed residence of approx. 230sq.m\r\nHigh Specifications and appointment throughout. \r\nElevated lands of approx.1.6 acres.  \r\nExquisite view over looking Bantry Bay.\r\nPrivate gated entrance.\r\nPossible development potential (SPP)."
